Notes : Mars and Jupiter are natural friends. In the Ascendants where they are the lords of the Angles and Trines and form some kind of connection between them, such Ascendants will depict extra ordinary results. In support of this statement, an example is cited here under : Data : Date of birth, 2-5-1964; Time of birth, 11-25 hrs. (IST)
Latitude 28°-43' (N); Longitude, 77°-50' (E);
Balance of Dasa: Venus 12 years; 1 month, 16 days. Antardasa of Jupiter in the Mahadasa of Mars: 2-12-1993 to 8-11-1994. The combination (Yoga) between Mars and Jupiter is formed in the 10th house in the sign of Aries and they are also the lords of Angle and Trine. The Sun, lord of the 2nd house (Wealth) and Mercury lord of the 12th house (Export) are also forming another Yoga. Jupiter is in the sign of exaltation both in Navamsa and Dasamsa and Mars is posited in its own sign Aries, in both these divisional charts. Consequently, the native achieved fabulous profits in his business during the sub-period of Jupiter in the Main period of Mars.

Notes: Mercury and Venus are the natural friends. In the Gemini or Virgo Ascendant, if Venus is posited in its own or exalted sign or associated with the Yogakaraka planets, the Antardasa of Venus will produce favourable results. In both these Ascendants, Venus gets the ownership of Trinal house and at the same time it will also own the 12th or 2nd house and as such Venus will not produce results as per the maxim i.e., "स्थानान्तरगुण्येन-----". Besides, the Antardasa of Venus in the Mahadasa of Mercury will give good effects in the Ascendant of Capricorn and Aquarius because Venus becomes Yogakaraka for these Ascendants and Mercury also takes on the ownership of the Trinal houses. In Libra Ascendant it will ascribe normal benefic results but will not be good for the health. However, the Ascendant of Taurus is generally seen to cause more health hazards. The only discernable reason could be that here Venus will represent body of the native (Ascendant) and disease (6th house) as it is evident from the illustration analysed hereafter. Data : Date of birth 26/27-8-1932; Time of birth 12-15 hrs (IST) Latitude, 28°-43' (N); Longitude, 77°-55' (E); Balance Dasa at birth, Rahu 16 years, 0 month, 15 days. In the birth chart, Venus the lord of the Ascendant and the 6th house which represent body and disease respectively is posited in the 2nd house. Weak Moon lord of the 3rd house is in conjunction with Venus and these planets are placed at the 12th position from the lord of Mahadasa (Mercury). In fact, the Moolatrikona sign of Venus falls in the 6th house and thus Venus will give specific results of this house i.e. there will be more of malefic effects. This lady (native) contracted mouth cancer during the Antardasa of Venus and the Mahadasa of Mercury which operated from 6-2-1987 to 6-12-1989. The Antardasa of Venus proves unfavourable for the Sagittarius and Pisces Ascendants particularly when Venus is placed in the sign of debilitation and Mercury is not posited in the auspicious houses. It is more damaging for the business activities in case of Sagittarius Ascendant, while for Pisces Ascendant, it create adverse situations for the native himself and his relationship with his wife. A native with Sagittarius Ascendant who was having a very good running business which got liquidated during the sub-period of Venus and he was forced to wind up his show and leave the town overnight. Here is yet another horoscope conforming to these rules : Data : Date of birth 29-11-1959; Time of birth, 9-35 hrs. (IST)
Latitude 28°-43' (N); Longitude, 77°-55' (E);
Balance of Dasa at birth; Jupiter 9 years, 2 months, 13 days. Venus is placed in the 10th house and in the sign of debilitation alongwith Rahu and duly aspected by Saturn. Mercury being in retrogression is also combust and posited in the 12th house. During the Mahadasa of Mercury and the Antardasa of Venus (from 28-6-1991 to 28-4-1994), the business of the native got badly affected due to the fraud committed by his elder brother and native had gone under heavy debts. Venus being the lord of the 11th house also signifies the elder brother. He also lost his father during this period.
